{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_title", "source_sha256": "4e40fa618b1948c57c65f2016d2d39382e1c1d2762be354f207970ee3cd02df1", "ja": "その手をひらけば", "zh": "若是张开那双手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_synopsis", "source_sha256": "59b51691f18e11f4ff0c01b041de47181d2b9dbf2a7174c48997ce68d7b953d0", "ja": "定期公演の新曲を任された志保。だが、弟が\n体調を崩した際、母が預けた給料を生活費に\n使っていない事を知る。自分は役に立たない\nのかと悩む志保だったが、プロデューサーの\n言葉で、母とも新曲とも素直に向き合う。", "zh": "志保受托负责定期公演的新歌。然而在弟弟身体不舒服时，她得知母亲并没有将自己寄存在那里的工资用作生活费。志保开始苦恼自己是不是派不上用场，但制作人的一番话，让她得以坦率面对母亲和新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1975d60fcda9d55f4cbde6d3bfef4d039fba05af72cdf25075a20aeacb82aef3", "ja": "（志保の新曲披露が終わった。\nお客さんの温かい拍手が鳴り響いている……）", "zh": "（志保的新歌演出结束了。\n观众们温暖的掌声回荡在会场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "8b56eb31f048ac303ff0509530fa90aa9a76e051481f9bf815920898d902a74f", "ja": "聞いてくれてありがとうございました。……あの。\nすこしだけ……私の話をさせてください。", "zh": "谢谢大家的聆听……那个。请让我稍微说说自己的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "a133f12d0e86a0326bdd73ec9dba6fddf8e4a937f078cb0087b5ab6ceac1c838", "ja": "志保……？", "zh": "志保……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "be3ca9f834a55d08c2588b0de1345d64315fba32ed9421dfb8a53ee42afb471f", "ja": "志保ちゃん……？", "zh": "志保……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a79184cb1d5085b4f47d3902a9eb96987adeb7bc94fb24acaa4868411d69aa4", "ja": "恥ずかしいのであまり言いたくないんですけど。初めて\n曲を聞いた時、私のことみたいだなって思いました。", "zh": "虽然挺不好意思的，不太想说出口。但第一次\n听到这首歌的时候，我觉得它就像是在写我一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "85d5a8caf417b6e91cca466f7e59edf840994019eca63058b23a9e3abfa69473", "ja": "私はいま、14歳で。世の中のいろんなことが、\nまだわかっていないかもしれません。けど……。", "zh": "我现在才14岁。对于世上的各种事情，或许还不是很了解。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "462a844890cbe17aac73df5a825fd68bd65edb7c247330308179a2f92b08ca79", "ja": "ここにいる仲間や、プロデューサーさん……\n大切な家族のおかげで、すこし変われた気がします。", "zh": "因为有在这里的伙伴，还有制作人先生……以及珍视的家人，我觉得自己似乎有了一点改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "b75621fe6bab95c6640044426ed0c5b1f6e2f3c48c9a7dfe46f84ce443038643", "ja": "私はこれからも、アイドルとしてがんばりたいです。\nどうか応援、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "今后我也想继续作为偶像努力。还请大家多多支持！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "d26a5ab8f86e2d2d137c8e5d89b54001881deecf2c486fcc31887fb503d2e221", "ja": "ワァアアアアアアア……！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7693cb986ea65f8da66ba5626af690c9ac8e25165e83fd0364fa2ef71c347caa", "ja": "志保……。", "zh": "志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a64f1464644bb00fdfd7f60841ce7ad25332adac9f9a61f7100910fd27d9729c", "ja": "（つたない言葉ながらも、志保はお客さんに、今の\n自分の想いを伝える事ができた。成長したな、志保！）", "zh": "（虽然说得不太流畅，但志保还是把自己此刻的心情传达给了客人。成长了啊，志保！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "5c90fe109a9b15a92ff4a1940be55e8253fc608af5a36c3ec6668cd6b6f48b1d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nあの、MCの内容、予定と変えてしまってすみません。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n那个，我很抱歉自己换掉了主持时原本预定好的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1012_p", "source_sha256": "767e8503a8b16bcb27efd360d614288af27bcc98e02c368e7a3ba9c30a124d7e", "ja": "いや、かえって良かったと思うよ。\n志保の想いがちゃんと伝わってきた。", "zh": "不会，我觉得反而很好哦。\n志保的心意确实好好传达出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "0fb6795953300ac776a59829007405ca00a1dc914807d88b469e9775e9241be7", "ja": "そうですか、ありがとうございます。……あの。\n今回、いろいろ心配かけて、すみませんでした。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢您。……那个。\n这次让您担心了很多，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "07dafdc67626a578f13d0686ca7c2e0da7d5b816510acb54ea9f87a5ebc84eb4", "ja": "これからも、アイドル続けたいと思いますので……\n引き続き、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "今后我也想继续当偶像……  \n还请您今后多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0291d137c9fa90b9d6ad9dcfc19f0e21fbc727a1d9185d409567b44609548071", "ja": "ああ。こちらこそ、これからもよろしくな！", "zh": "啊，我才是，今后也请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "9158af048f19e2ad84c2d14e5bb5e3a3554658e3a48088051df07c7c695bfcf1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、志保！\nもう、ふたりとも話しこんでる場合ちゃいますよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生、志保！\n真是的，现在可不是你们俩顾着聊天的场合哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "9f363cff7373bfd0e6fcc772fb62773a2ab15595f822bdfab4f415184bb081db", "ja": "奈緒さん？", "zh": "奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "a685b6fdc7e30070cb04c0bbc510ede83f5d25c723abfd64b130ff0bbde4fdf7", "ja": "志保。{$P$}も、\nアンコール、聞こえてないんですか？", "zh": "志保，还有{$P$}，\n你们听不到安可声吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1019_audience", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4fab537838bb9b95c6ec988cdc1419109ec72825039efe67542fa0f274bd7e1f", "ja": "あっ、すまない。\nつい話し込んじゃってたな。", "zh": "啊，不好意思。一不小心聊得太投入了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "dda78c6f6e76d8dc30705deea606ec43a5e0a02df971dcd217260c05d15f8c0c", "ja": "{$P$}さんと志保ちゃんでも、\nそんなことがあるんだね～。えへっ♪", "zh": "就算是{$P$}先生和志保，\n也会有这种时候呢～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "d276373598eebe4662dd4bd1167453c351a9683ff82c6ceb86d25d7311237d0c", "ja": "そうね。つまり、ふたりともまだまだ、\n私たちの助けが必要ってことじゃないかしら？", "zh": "是啊。也就是说，你们两个还远远离不开我们的帮助，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "bbc575f99db40ed9e8479081af243fd58e26571b0df85cceb397ec5975239e60", "ja": "な、何よ……。", "zh": "干、干什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "2f15f03d60348fd2a30b62fb0192b74d285de0a461b8787b02fd6efaa1a0e09e", "ja": "別に。そうかもしれないと思っただけ。", "zh": "没什么。只是觉得也许是这样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "e71bbee6960e302d95a6f37b80e11f0f71337cb8754022fac68834188b4c7f8e", "ja": "え！？", "zh": "诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "02ca97e693a5b273b5a7e97e8b393b9bb92630477016c60bc342b31c9b670dbf", "ja": "ふふっ♪　……{$P$}さん、\nみんな、まだまだ元気いっぱいみたいですね？", "zh": "呵呵♪……{$P$}先生，\n大家好像还都精神十足呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_078_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "bd1868f38732e25b97ff195dbfa201b5e8dd961480ee506637554ce01c914406", "ja": "ほな、いっちょやったりますか！\n{$P$}さん、お願いしますね♪", "zh": "那就来大干一场吧！\n{$P$}先生，拜托你啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
